### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Policy premium by line of business
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is annual premium and policy count by line of business?",
  "row_limit": 100,
  "include_debug": true
}

### Claims loss ratio
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Show loss ratio by line of business.",
  "business_domain": "claims",
  "row_limit": 100,
  "include_debug": true
}

### Campaign performance
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Which campaigns generated the most conversion premium?",
  "business_domain": "campaign",
  "row_limit": 50
}

### Agent performance
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Which agents had the highest quote-to-bind rate last quarter?",
  "business_domain": "agent",
  "row_limit": 50
}

